{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1sJkSdYN8pbqCWgTJuGWN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **lg_instruction_ablation** (killed): D021 Exp-1: Instruction Ablation. Extract LIBERO-Goal features with empty instruction (trained + untrained VLA), then run RSA. If instruction pathway is the source of action-relevant structure, RSA should collapse from ρ≈0.49 to <0.15. PASS: ρ<0.15; PARTIAL: 0.15<ρ<0.30; FAIL: ρ≥0.30.\\\\n- **lg_output_head_analysis** (killed): D021 Exp-2: Output Head Analysis. Compare trained vs untrained VLA weight differences across layers. If training does \\\\\\\"shallow adaptation\\\\\\\", output head weight diff >> middle layer weight diff. Explains \\\\\\\"representations unchanged but behavior improved\\\\\\\".\\\\n- **plan_012_clip_vit_control** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 30 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 45\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_instruction_ablation: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_output_head_analysis: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1192, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WZxVFvGeKNdv939vUq8V6Z","session_id":"18723999-1838-4cd3-86c2-800e5e9f555a","uuid":"911ff44c-ead1-4aa1-9f16-6ab9b2543eeb","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:48:32.964Z"}
