{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MXhNr2BrZZ3HFY6uGorsBm","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# vla-ssd — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 00:14 UTC | 更新原因: Sync with D033/D034, CKA results, plan_008 running, updated Claims\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA 中 action-relevant 表征的来源与 LLM 的 redistribution 机制。三层发现：(1) Vision encoder 是 action info 的通用源头，VL pretraining 赋予 geometric alignment 而非额外 predictive content；(2) LLM 降解分布式 image token 几何结构（RSA）但保留全局结构（CKA），通过训练依赖的 attention 将信号 concentrate 到 readout token；(3) Training 教会 routing（readout concentration），而非 creating new knowledge（distributed structure invariant）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research phase, post-D034**。三条 Claim 完整成型，所有 P0 实验完成。等待：(1) untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI（已派 Agent）；(2) plan_008 random instruction control（RUNNING）。两者完成后 re-dream 验证新 framing，达标则启动 Paper Agent。\\\\n\\\\n## 已完成核心实验\\\\n- ✅ plan_001-007: RSA 组件分解 + 2×2 matrix + per-layer curve + instruction ablation\\\\n- ✅ plan_011: Functional action probe — Proj R²=0.706 > LLM img_mean 0.683 (p=0.001); readout 0.731 > Proj (p=0.001)\\\\n- ✅ plan_009: CKA verification — ordering reversal vs RSA (partial). RSA-CKA dissociation 成为新 finding\\\\n- ✅ D033: DINO R²=0.712 ≈ Projector 0.706 (p=0.22) — geometric-functional dissociation\\\\n- ✅ D034: Untrained readout R²=0.686 < projector 0.706 — redistribution is training-dependent\\\\n- ✅ Aggregation robustness: image_mean RSA 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114\\\\n- ✅ Bootstrap CI: training effect on image_mean CI includes 0, distributed structure invariant\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI（Agent 已派，分钟级）\\\\n- [ ] plan_008 random instruction control 结果分析（RUNNING，等完成）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream with updated framing（上述两项完成后立即触发）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent Full Draft（re-dream 达标后启动）\\\\n- [ ] plan_012 CLIP-ViT control（P1，Paper Agent 启动后并行）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-19183: 2× GPU（plan_008 占用中）\\\\n剩余预算: ~7 GPU·h\\\\n\\\\n## 关键里程碑\\\\n| 日期 | 事件 |\\\\n|------|------|\\\\n| 5/15 | MVP PASS → Dream → D030 → plan_011 PASS → D031 redistribution |\\\\n| 5/16 | D033 geometric-functional dissociation, D034 training-dependent redistribution, plan_009 CKA done |\\\\n| 5/16 | **paper_framing.md 三条 Claim 定稿** |\\\\n| 5/16-17 | bootstrap CI + plan_008 → re-dream |\\\\n| 5/17-18 | Paper Agent Full Draft |\\\\n| 5/26 | CoRL abstract DDL |\\\\n| 5/29 | CoRL paper DDL |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-16 | Paper Agent 与 re-dream 并行启动。Dream 卡在 writing 3h+，不 | plan_008_random_inst_control, dream_20260516T011810 |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | Untrained last_preaction R²=0.689 < projector 0.70 | p0_functional_probe_v2 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-15 | DINO R²=0.712 ≈ Projector R²=0.706 (p=0.22) — Clai | p0_functional_probe_v2 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-15 | Confirm Option A framing (\\\\\\\"LLM routes, not creates | p0_functional_action_probe, p0_functional_action_delta_probe |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-15 | Claim 2 framing pivot: \\\\\\\"LLM degrades\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"LLM redis | p0_functional_action_probe |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-15 | D030: Dream 三档均低于 acceptance（best borderline rejec | d027_siglip_only_rsa, mvp2_action_trained, mvp2_action_dino |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-15 | D029: Claim 2 聚合伪影排除。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501 仍远低于 | d027_siglip_only_rsa, plan_003_perlayer_degradation, d027_trained_no_inst_rsa |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-15 | D028: SigLIP-only RSA smoking gun PASS (0.615 >> 0 | d027_siglip_only_rsa, d027_trained_no_inst_rsa, d021_instruction_ablation |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | D027: Instruction Ablation FAIL — Option B 死亡，回退 O | d021_instruction_ablation, d021_output_head_analysis, lg_rsa_analysis |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | D025: Output head analysis FAIL — shallow adaptati | d021_output_head_analysis, d021_instruction_ablation |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3529, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WZxVFvGeKNdv939vUq8V6Z","session_id":"18723999-1838-4cd3-86c2-800e5e9f555a","uuid":"b34e0bf5-ea9b-4541-ace0-60a268cb0f56","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:48:33.900Z"}
